*set* | V-$CHIPVR ($CHIPCN)

''set(container, index, value)''

Sets an element at the specified index in a list or bytes, returning a new copy.

*Parameters:*
- ''container'': List or bytes to modify
- ''index'': Number index position
- ''value'': New value (any type for list, number 0-255 for bytes)

*Returns:*
- List/Bytes: New copy of container with element modified

*Errors:*
- Runtime error if container is not list or bytes
- Runtime error if index is not a number
- Runtime error if index is out of bounds
- Runtime error if setting byte value outside 0-255 range
